 retries</span>\n    </div>\n    <div\n      class=\"diagram-node\"\n      data-node=\"kc\"\n      data-shape=\"bar\"\n      data-tone=\"muted\"\n      data-step=\"7\"\n      style=\"--col: 1; --row: 5; --span: 5\"\n    >\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Identity</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Keycloak</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">SSO · OIDC for every UI</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <ol class=\"diagram-edges\">\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"pg\" data-to=\"nifi\">JDBC</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"forms\" data-to=\"kafka\">HTTP</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"nifi\" data-to=\"minio\">write</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"kafka\" data-to=\"minio\">sink</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"minio\" data-to=\"spark\" data-tone=\"accent\">read</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"spark\" data-to=\"dbt\" data-line=\"dashed\"></li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"dbt\" data-to=\"superset\">SQL</li>\n  </ol>\n</figure>\n","individual":true},{"label":"High-level, flowing","html":"<figure class=\"diagram\" id=\"dg-high-flow\" data-type=\"high-level\" aria-label=\"Data stack on Kubernetes, high level\">\n  <figcaption class=\"diagram-caption\">\n    <span class=\"diagram-eyebrow\">High-level</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-title\">The data stack on Kubernetes</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-dek\"\n      >Phases on top, the cluster boundary around the platform, cross-cutting concerns as bars.</span\n    >\n  </figcaption>\n  <div class=\"diagram-canvas\" style=\"--cols: 5; --diagram-col-min: 7.5rem; --diagram-node-w: 9rem\">\n    <ol class=\"diagram-phases\" style=\"--row: 1; --col: 1; --span: 5\">\n      <li>Sources</li>\n      <li>Ingestion</li>\n      <li data-tone=\"accent\">Storage</li>\n      <li>Transform</li>\n      <li>Visualize</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"diagram-group\" data-node=\"ext\" style=\"--col: 1; --